/** MagneticLetters (DESIGN-SPEC v2 9, P-home): renders its slot (the server-rendered H1, marked
 * `data-magnetic-letters`) untouched. scripts/bencho/magnetic-letters.ts, after `load` + idle and only on ≥ 1024 +
 * pointer-fine + motion, rebuilds the H1 as a visually hidden full text plus an aria-hidden per-letter copy that keeps
 * the same `.l` line spans (no CLS, no new LCP entry). Static H1 otherwise. */
---
<slot />
<style is:global>
  [data-magnetic-letters] .ml-w { display: inline-block; white-space: nowrap; }
  [data-magnetic-letters] .ml-c { display: inline-block; will-change: auto; }
  [data-magnetic-letters].is-magnetic .ml-c { will-change: transform; }
</style>
